{
  "song_id": 31411,
  "title": "Fazers",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70,
    8019
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"Follow the light, the light is your guide\"",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "\"I am controller of Planet X\" (Three, three)",
          "rhyme": "iks",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"And I've invited you here to discuss something that's very important\"",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "King Geedorah, take me to your leader",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Quick to claim that he not no snake like, \"Me neither\"",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "They need to take a breather",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He been rhyming longer than Sigmund the sea creature",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Been on Saturday feature, pleased to meet ya",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And came to wake you up out the deep sleeper, like",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "He needed to stop before he caught the knee-drop",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Even give you more zip-zip than ZZ Top",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "With full beards, thou shall not mar corner",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Geedorah like, \"One more steps and y'alls goners\"",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "So-called rich, front if you wanna",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "When he spit electrics, don't be in y'all saunas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "He only here to warn us what the plan is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "The hour is upon us, it's bananas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Born alone, die alone, no matter who your man is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Hope he live long enough to tell it to his grandkids",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "King Geedorah, three-finger ring fever",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Spring chicken eater, ID'ed as the ringleader",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Who needs a heater? Catch 'em with bare hands",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "These same hands that make razors out beer cans",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "His own biggest fan",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "And got a fan base as big as Japan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Uh, yeah...? And?",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "All hail the King and give him three cheers, fam (Fam?)",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Like, \"Hip, hip, hooray\"",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Do his thing for the little kings, like Sling Blade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "To the grave, put in work like a slave",
          "rhyme": "av",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "On how to flip scripts on the dipstick brigade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Rock 'em like \"Sus-sussudio\" played",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Back when we used to rock the shag, no fade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "This skilled trade like a tailor-made suede",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Hit the studio and I'm paid",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Half upfront, half upon mastering",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "\"Would you like that in cash?\" Last thing you should ask the King",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "You don't have to be no crystal ball reader",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Allergic to saltpeter, used to be a wall beater",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "In the game, like a Wall Street cheater",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "A lot of rap noise is annoying, like Cita",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Turn into a triple-X monster from a fairy tale movie",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "He don't know me very well, do he?",
          "rhyme": "af",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "King Geedorah, crush on the seed's teacher",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "They need to pay 'em better, she had nothing on the reefer",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Heifer, and I had to offer her a stick of gum",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "She was as thick as they come and taught a strict curriculum (Dumb bitch)",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Which is only good for my son",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "When I'm in the hood, razors on tongue",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Nowadays, it's amazing raising young",
          "rhyme": "uN",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Rule number one: keep your fazers on stun",
          "rhyme": "(",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBCDEFFBADDGDGHIAJJKJJLGMNMIMHOPPAAADQRIISSTUVW",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCDBEEBADDBDBFGAHHDHHFBDDDGDFBFFAAADFDGGEEIIJK"
    }
  ]
}